## Allowed Methods & Tools

Students were permitted to use:
- **Model Types:** RNN, LSTM, GRU, 1D Convolutional Layers, regression slope on subintervals
- **Frameworks:** Keras, TensorFlow, PyTorch, scikit-learn
- **Techniques:** Clustering, dimensionality reduction, outlier detection/treatment, feature engineering, hyperparameter tuning, sampling strategies, regularization, stepwise selection
- **Hardware:** CPU, GPU, TPU

